OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FA convicted fraudster cleared in court
OL,7,Fof killing his wealthy heiress wife
OL,8,Fmurdered her, a coroner said.
OL,10,FConman Donald McPherson, 53, was
OL,11,Fordered to be found not guilty of the
OL,12,Fmurder of his wife Paula Leeson, 47,
OL,13,Fon a judge's direction to the jury
OL,14,Fhalfway through his trial at
OL,15,FManchester Crown Court in 2021.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
