OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786042167
OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FHe had taken out #3.5 million life
OL,7,Finsurance on the mother-of-one shortly
OL,8,Fbefore her death on June 6, 2017, and
OL,9,Fwithin hours of her "accidental
OL,10,Fdrowning" was emptying her accounts of
OL,11,Fthousands of pounds to pay off his
OL,12,Fdebts.
OL,14,FTwo years ago Ms Leeson's family, who
OL,15,Frun a successful plant hire business
OL,16,Fin south Manchester, blocked him
OL,17,Finheriting his late wife's #4.4
OL,18,Fmillion estate.
OL,26,@qD@UOUrD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
