OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FA judge in civil proceedings brought
OL,7,Fby the Leeson family at the High Court
OL,8,Fruled McPherson had unlawfully killed
OL,9,Fhis wife for money by throttling her
OL,10,Funconscious then drowning her in the
OL,11,Fswimming pool while on holiday in
OL,12,FDenmark in 2017.
OL,14,FAt the inquest into the death of Ms
OL,15,FLeeson, delayed until Thursday by the
OL,16,Fmurder trial and civil hearings, a
OL,17,Fcoroner ruled she agreed with the
OL,18,Funlawful killing verdict.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786042167
OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FAlison Mutch, senior coroner for
OL,7,FManchester South, told Stockport
OL,8,FCoroner's Court McPherson was heavily
OL,9,Fin debt and he was the only person to
OL,10,Fbenefit from his wife's death.
OL,12,FShe added: "I am therefore satisfied
OL,13,Fhe did murder his wife. Her death
OL,14,Foccurred because her husband
OL,15,Fcompressed her neck to render her
OL,16,Funconscious, causing her body to enter
OL,17,Fthe pool, causing her to drown, to
OL,18,Ffinancially benefit from her death.
OL,19,FHer death was as a result of an
OL,20,Funlawful killing."
OL,26,@tD@LOU|D@RO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
