OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FMs Leeson drowned in the swimming pool
OL,7,Fat a remote holiday cottage, booked by
OL,8,FMcPherson for a summer break in
OL,9,FDenmark in 2017.
OL,11,FShe was 5ft 5in and could swim but
OL,12,Fdrowned in the pool of a depth of 4ft,
OL,13,Fthe murder trial heard.
OL,15,FMcPherson told police he awoke to find
OL,16,FMs Leeson face down in the pool.
OL,18,FHer death was initially treated as a
OL,19,Ftragic accident by the Danish
OL,20,Fauthorities ` though she had 13
OL,21,Fseparate external injuries.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
