FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786042167
OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FWithin hours McPherson was
OL,7,Ftransferring thousands of pounds from
OL,8,Fher accounts.
OL,10,FSoon after, McPherson cleared their
OL,11,Fhome in Sale, Greater Manchester, of
OL,12,Fhis late wife's possessions and joined
OL,13,Fbereavement group Widowed And Young `
OL,14,Fwhich he called "Tinder for widows".
OL,16,FDetective Chief Inspector Daniel
OL,17,FClegg, of Greater Manchester Police
OL,18,Fsaid: "There's no doubt this was a
OL,19,Fhomicide. She died at his hands. I
OL,20,Fhave not looked for anyone else."
OL,26,@vD@QOUvD@cO]zD@GOU|D@aO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
