PN,36207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786042167
OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FThe coroner asked the officer: "You
OL,7,Fdon't believe this was an accident.
OL,8,FThere's too many coincidences and only
OL,9,Fone person benefited from her death?"
OL,10,FHe replied: "That's right."
OL,12,FSophie Cartwright KC, representing the
OL,13,FLeeson family at the inquest, asked
OL,14,Fthe officer: "Your firm belief is that
OL,15,FDonald McPherson murdered Paula
OL,16,FLeeson?"
OL,26,@nD@`OUqD@eO]rD@MOUrD@[O]vD@NOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786042167
OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FMr Clegg replied: "That's correct,
OL,7,Fyes. Donald McPherson had backed
OL,8,Fhimself into a financial crisis and
OL,9,Fthe only way out was with the death of
OL,10,Fhis wife."
OL,12,FThe officer said he agreed with the
OL,13,FLeeson's family view that this had
OL,14,Fbeen a miscarriage of justice and
OL,15,FMcPherson, currently living in New
OL,16,FZealand, should be serving a life
OL,17,Fsentence for murder.
OL,19,FThe inquest heard no retrial for
OL,20,Fmurder can take place unless
OL,21,Fcompelling new evidence is found.
OL,26,@nD@SOUrD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786042167
OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FMs Cartwright said "investigations are
OL,7,Fongoing" and the Leeson family hope
OL,8,Fpolice, having in the last 12 months
OL,9,Fgained access to McPherson's old
OL,10,Flaptop, will uncover evidence to "get
OL,11,Fthem over the line for a retrial",
OL,12,Fadding: "Their fight will continue
OL,13,Fafter today."
OL,15,FMcPherson has always denied any
OL,16,Finvolvement in his wife's death,
OL,17,Fdescribing it a "tragic accident".
OL,26,@nD@TOUoD@HO]rD@bOUsD@aO]tD@IOUuD@MO]yD@
OL,26,AQOUyD@aO]
