OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786042167
OL,3,CCoroner rules fraudster cleared of
OL,4,Ckilling wealthy wife did murder her
OL,6,FHis lawyers argued Ms Leeson's
OL,7,Finjuries could be a result of her
OL,8,Frescue from the pool and resuscitation
OL,9,Fand pathologists could not rule out
OL,10,Fthat she could have fainted or
OL,11,Faccidentally fallen into the pool and
OL,12,Fdrowned.
OL,14,FMcPherson's murder trial was halted by
OL,15,FMr Justice Goose, ruling insufficient
OL,16,Fevidence for jurors to safely convict
OL,17,Fas accidental death could not be ruled
OL,18,Fout.
OL,20,FHe directed the jury to return a not
OL,21,Fguilty verdict to murder.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/10
